# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — conan apply_conandata_patches 默认 strip=0 导致 a/ b/ 前缀补丁应用失败 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-29
# Software: mklibs 0.1.46（任何 refresh-patch 生成 a/ b/ 前缀补丁的 autotools/conan 包）
# Gate: conan create build() apply_conandata_patches
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: draft-mklibs-0.1.46-conandata-patch-strip-default-zero
title: conan apply_conandata_patches 默认 strip=0 —— refresh-patch 生成的 a/ b/ 前缀补丁必须显式 strip: 1，否则 conan create 在 build() 首步失败
trigger_tool: conan create / apply_conandata_patches / patch_ng
phase: build
error_signature: source/target file does not exist:.*(a/|b/).*|Failed to apply patch:.*\.patch|Failed to parse patch
severity: 2
category: conan|patch
match_keywords: strip, strip: 1, apply_conandata_patches, patch_file, a/ b/ prefix,
  Failed to apply patch, source/target file does not exist, patch_ng, strip_root
keywords: strip, strip: 1, apply_conandata_patches, patch_file, a/ b/ prefix,
  Failed to apply patch, source/target file does not exist, patch_ng, refresh-patch
approach: 在 conandata.yml 的每条 patch entry 显式写 `strip: 1`（conan.tools.files.patches.patch()
  默认 strip=0，patch_ng 在 strip=0 时会把 `a/lib/...`、`b/lib/...` 当作真实路径查找，必然
  "source/target file does not exist"）。apply_conandata_patches 会把 entry 的其余字段作为
  kwargs 透传给 patch()，因此条级 `strip:` 直接生效；仓库既有 125 个 conandata.yml 即采用该写法。
  注意与 source() 的 `strip_root` 区分：后者处理源码 tarball 顶层目录（Debian native 包形如
  mklibs-0.1.46/，需 strip_root=True），二者是不同层面的剥离。
evidence: mklibs-0.1.46-wt/archives/m/mklibs/0.1.46/reports/conan-create.log
  （修复前：`--- b'a/lib/mklibs/utils/logging.py'` + `+++ b'b/...'` → Failed to apply patch；
   加 strip: 1 后 5 个补丁全部应用成功）
last_updated: 2026-09-29
